{"3303890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alien Dark Wars", "steam_appid": 3303890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >After a secret mission to recover alien wreckage goes terribly wrong, race to stop UFOs abducting soldiers in real time, confront hostile forces, and uncover a truth hidden for centuries that could ignite a war between worlds.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Aerial Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot combat helicopters with realistic physics-based flight. Combine precise shooting, tactical maneuvers, and alien-enhanced firepower to defend soldiers from hostile alien waves and stop UFO abductions in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/7136531200aea655ff987346ed8aed13.poster.avif?t=1783082777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/7136531200aea655ff987346ed8aed13.webm?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/7136531200aea655ff987346ed8aed13.mp4?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Biomes and Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across tropical islands, harsh deserts, and frozen mountain landscapes in a mission-driven campaign. Each chapter introduces new enemies, environmental challenges, and key rescue missions that drive the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/bd90de045edb8efd80cc332ab5678be4.poster.avif?t=1783082777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/bd90de045edb8efd80cc332ab5678be4.webm?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/bd90de045edb8efd80cc332ab5678be4.mp4?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helicopter Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the agile Little Bird and unlock the more powerful Cobra. Upgrade your weapons and helicopter systems to transform conventional firepower into alien technology, and turn the hunters into the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/af9077cd5c5fa9096480182a2468dfa4.poster.avif?t=1783082777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/af9077cd5c5fa9096480182a2468dfa4.webm?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/af9077cd5c5fa9096480182a2468dfa4.mp4?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue key survivors before they are taken, uncover the secrets behind the alien invasion, and reveal a truth hidden for centuries that could ignite a war between worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/3c7e36a8d85dc0ce89fd1b3a071a9ec1.poster.avif?t=1783082777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/3c7e36a8d85dc0ce89fd1b3a071a9ec1.webm?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/3c7e36a8d85dc0ce89fd1b3a071a9ec1.mp4?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >After a secret mission to recover alien wreckage goes terribly wrong, race to stop UFOs abducting soldiers in real time, confront hostile forces, and uncover a truth hidden for centuries that could ignite a war between worlds.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Aerial Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot combat helicopters with realistic physics-based flight. Combine precise shooting, tactical maneuvers, and alien-enhanced firepower to defend soldiers from hostile alien waves and stop UFO abductions in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/7136531200aea655ff987346ed8aed13.poster.avif?t=1783082777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/7136531200aea655ff987346ed8aed13.webm?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/7136531200aea655ff987346ed8aed13.mp4?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Biomes and Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across tropical islands, harsh deserts, and frozen mountain landscapes in a mission-driven campaign. Each chapter introduces new enemies, environmental challenges, and key rescue missions that drive the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo